  "details": "Because the rebaking gets done locally the offsets will drift more and more and is very prone to desyncing the position from local to remote users.\n\nI think it would be a good idea to have an option to have the rebaking only be done locally and have the offsets synced to other clients.\n\nThis way it can be used to grab and place props very seamlessly without positional desyncing between clients.",
